    "Your organization requires a passkey for your passwd-sso account. Until you register one in your browser, passwd-sso can't save new passkeys. For this site, use another passkey provider, such as iCloud Keychain, for now." : {
      "comment" : "Explains why passwd-sso cannot save this passkey.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your organization requires a passkey for your passwd-sso account. Until you register one in your browser, passwd-sso can't save new passkeys. For this site, use another passkey provider, such as iCloud Keychain, for now."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "組織の設定により、passwd-sso のアカウントにはパスキーが必要です。ブラウザでパスキーを登録するまで、passwd-sso では新しいパスキーを保存できません。このサイトでは、当面は iCloud キーチェーンなど別のパスキー保存先を使用してください。"
          }
        }
      }
